('PLAYER-009','players','One primary guardian per Tanner','A Tanner may have multiple linked contacts but at most one primary guardian; new profile updates reuse an existing guardian by canonical phone when possible.','legacy',90,'database','active','tested','legacy tutor/phone + ux_player_guardians_one_primary / private.command_update_player_profile','{"qa":"single primary guardian + canonical phone + rollback clean"}'::jsonb),
('PLAYER-010','players','Player profile updates are transactional with category change','Profile fields and category change are saved in one backend transaction; category continues through relational enrollment history rather than a free-form category overwrite.','approved_v2',100,'command','active','tested','private.command_save_player_profile','{"qa":"profile command validated legacy foot, future birth date, guardian invariant"}'::jsonb),
('DOC-001','players','Legacy document checklist is preserved without eligibility side effects','Acta, CURP and studies are tracked as received/missing with timestamp and actor. Because all 67 active legacy players had all three flags false, missing documents do not automatically block participation, billing or activation.','legacy',90,'command','active','tested','public.players doc_acta/doc_curp/doc_studies -> app.player_document_status','{"seeded":201,"legacyReceived":0,"qa":"CURP toggle + invalid type + rollback"}'::jsonb)
